# AI-context exclusions, not a security boundary for terminal or MCP tools.
# Never print or attach real secret values.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
!/.env.example

# Permit the non-secret implementation roadmap while .local stays Git-ignored.
# Re-include its parent first; keep every other local path excluded.
!/.local/
/.local/**
!/.local/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md

# The dependency lockfile is useful project evidence, not a secret.
!/package-lock.json
